WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:03.109
Dingo: Well hello there, friend! Welcome, welcome!

2
00:00:03.409 --> 00:00:07.536
Dingo: I'm Dingo, head chef of this little kitchen. What's your name?

3
00:00:07.836 --> 00:00:10.997
Dingo: {name}! What a great name. So happy to meet you!

4
00:00:11.297 --> 00:00:17.645
Dingo: Today's a big day. My two little apprentices are learning to cook, and I need a helper. That's you!

5
00:00:17.945 --> 00:00:22.098
Dingo: Let's make some yummy onion soup together. Ready? Follow me!

